('UI Misalignment on Mobile Landscape View (iOS)', 'On iPhone 14 models the top navigation bar shifts down in landscape orientation and hides content.', 'maria.rodriguez@example.com', 'P2 - Medium', 'In Progress', NOW() - INTERVAL '9 days'),
('Critical XZ Utils Backdoor Detected in Core Dependency (CVE-2024-3094)', 'Supply-chain compromise CVE-2024-3094 in XZ Utils 5.6.0 and 5.6.1 may allow unauthorized remote SSH access via a modified liblzma. Investigate all Linux services that depend on XZ Utils.', 'frank.white@example.com', 'P0 - Critical', 'Open', NOW() - INTERVAL '1 day'),
